{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>I will remember</b> — Some say: before David, for because of his sons who were officers, the memory of his name shall stand and his glory shall be told from generation to generation. And some say: for your name, before the honored Name, for the psalmist gives thanks to HaShem for the greatness of David and his seed."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:30:57.927201928Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}